        <h3>Where December 12 Fell in Each Run</h3>
        <p>The weeks split three ways:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>{{N_FIRST}} songs were in their first week at number one: "The Tears of a Clown," "I Am Woman," "Kung Fu Fighting," "Le Freak" and "Babe."</li>
          <li>{{N_MID}} were in the middle of a longer run: "Family Affair," "Fly, Robin, Fly," "Tonight's the Night (Gonna Be Alright)" and "You Light Up My Life."</li>
          <li>One was in the last week of its run: "Top of the World."</li>
        </ul>

